SELECT define_rule($q${"rule_id": "LCC.dh_ao9_secondary_dwelling_siting", "instrument_version": "LCC_PLANNING_SCHEME_2015@2025-07-01", "topic": "SEPARATION.BUILDINGS", "title": "Table 9.3.2.3.1 PO9/AO9", "role": "REQUIREMENT", "regime": "BUILDING", "enforceability": "DEEMED_TO_COMPLY", "provision_kind": "ACCEPTABLE_OUTCOME", "measurement": "SCHEME_SEPARATION", "operator": "<=", "value": 20, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "REFERRAL_TO_LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "effective_from": "2025-07-01", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "LOGAN"}], "subjects": ["CLASS_1"], "sources": [{"key": "dh_ao9_secondary_dwelling_siting", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"max_distance_from_primary_dwelling\", \"operator\": \"<=\", \"value\": 20, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"primary street setback >= that of the Dwelling house\"], \"exceptions\": [], \"formula_text\": null}\nStructure scope 'secondary dwelling / Dual occupancy (auxiliary unit)' mapped by keyword to ['CLASS_1']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: YES\nResearcher notes: Basis: Part 1 s1.6(3) Table 1.6.1: 'Alternative provisions to the QDC site cover provisions | Dual occupancy and Dwelling house code: a. PO3/AO3 - maximum site cover b. PO7/AO7 - maximum gross floor area for class 10a buildings c. PO8/AO8 - maximum gross floor area for Dual occupancy (auxiliary unit) or secondary dwelling d. PO9/AO9 for maximum distance between dwellings for Dual occupancy (auxiliary unit) or secondary dwelling. | Section 33(2) BA.'"}$q$::jsonb);
