 code assessment of other uses). Table 5.7.1 also nominates the zone code for building work for uses other than Dual occupancy (auxiliary unit)/Dwelling house. So this zone provision is generally NOT a requirement for a house or its Class 10a outbuildings."}$q$::jsonb);
